---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = '加入我們';
---
<Layout title={title}>
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>{title}</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">追蹤我們的社群，第一時間接收喜劇資訊。</p>
  </header>
  
  <div class="cards-container">
    <section class="card">
      <h2>社群連結</h2>
      <p>歡迎透過以下平台追蹤我們的最新動態：</p>
      <div class="button-group">
        <a href="https://line.me/ti/g2/io-WX_6DEx0N8c43pJkDsWcXlkoqjXvm5NZAFA?utm_source=invitation&utm_medium=link_copy&utm_campaign=default" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button line">LINE 交流群組</a>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/nycucomedy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button ig">Instagram (@nycucomedy)</a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/people/%E9%99%BD%E6%98%8E%E4%BA%A4%E5%A4%A7%E8%B2%A2%E4%B8%B8%E5%96%9C%E5%8A%87%E7%A4%BE-NYCU-Comedy-Club/61563966988944/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button fb">Facebook 粉絲專頁</a>
        <a href="https://clubportal.nycu.edu.tw/club/view/info/9B845C6A-FABE-4A8F-BC79-2E544BDF9A59/outside" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="social-button portal">陽明交大社團系統入口</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card">
      <h2>電子報訂閱</h2>
      <p>如果你想收到我們的最新資訊 (Gmail)，歡迎訂閱我們：</p>
      <div class="iframe-container">
        <!-- Substack Embed Code (Removed light=1 for dark mode support) -->
        <iframe src="https://seanhhl.substack.com/embed?transparent=1" width="100%" height="150" style="border: 0; background: transparent; max-width: 480px;" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"></iframe>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .cards-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 0;
    background: transparent;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }
  
  .card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: var(--surface-card);
    z-index: -1;
  }
  
  .card::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--accent-blue), var(--accent-orange));
    z-index: -2;
    filter: blur(15px);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  
  .card:hover::after {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .card h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.2);
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .button-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .social-button {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white !important;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.1s ease, filter 0.2s ease;
  }

  .social-button:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    filter: brightness(1.1);
  }

  .social-button:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }
  
  /* Brand Colors */
  .line { background-color: #06C755; }
  .ig { background: linear-gradient(45deg, #f09433 0%, #e6683c 25%, #dc2743 50%, #cc2366 75%, #bc1888 100%); }
  .fb { background-color: #1877F2; }
  .portal { background-color: #4a5568; }

  .iframe-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }
</style>
